The ghost level is meant to simulate the old game of rogue, from which
nethack is derived. It might look weird to you, but nethack is suposed
to look like that too. In any normal level, go to the map menu and
select something other than tiles and you'll see how most people play
it, or used to. When the pictures (tiles) were added, it just wasn't
right to change rogue, so it was left with letters anyway.

There is (I think) one situation where it's useful to know which
letter represents which monster, but you probably won't run into it
anytime soon.

